# Production build — `npm run build` (Vite mode: production). Netlify runs this.
# All API calls go to /api (SAME-ORIGIN with the SPA at https://claims-crm.netlify.app).
# Netlify proxies /api/* to the Railway backend (see public/_redirects), so the
# httpOnly auth cookie is first-party and sent on every request (fixes the 401s).
VITE_BACKEND_BASE_URL=/api
VITE_BACKEND_BASE_URL2=/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
